title: OpenAI Platform: Organization overview
agents: openai_platform
catalog: app
license: GPLv2
distribution: checkmk-openai extension
description: Shows current organization inventory: projects and users. These totals are live provider inventory and are intentionally not checked against fixed expected numbers because projects and users can change over time. Optional semantic conditions such as zero users are configurable. Project documentation: https://help.openai.com/en/articles/9186755-managing-projects-in-the-api-platform.
discovery: One service is created whenever organization inventory is available.
